WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:13.900
Step 0 | fiddy provision - rent the compute. 4 vCPU, 16 GB RAM, 1.5-2 TB disk. AWS with --aws, or any server with --ssh user@host.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:28.400
Step 1 | fiddy node up - a Snapchain read node on your server. It answers the API at once, then catches up on history.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:42.400
Step 2 | fiddy client up - the web client reads and writes through your own node. Login is one gasless app key.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:49.400
Your feed, your casts, your reads - served by your own node. Plus the agent no other client has.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.400
Three commands. That is the whole install.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.900
Full tutorial fiddy.fun/client - source github.com/ivcained/fiddy - Chinese guide fiddy.fun/client/zh

